extends layout

block content
  h1= title
  p Welcome to #[em LocalLibrary], a very basic Express website developed as a tutorial example on the Mozilla Developer Network.

  h1 Dynamic content

  p The library has the following record counts:

  ul
    li #[strong 書籍:] !{book_count}
    li #[strong 冊数:] !{book_instance_count}
    li #[strong 貸出可能な冊数:] !{book_instance_available_count}
    li #[strong 著者:] !{author_count}
    li #[strong ジャンル:] !{genre_count}
